      "text": "SELECT latest.id, t.count\nFROM (\n  SELECT id, max(update_time) AS update_time\n  FROM test\n  WHERE id = ANY ($1::bigint[])\n    -- ERROR HERE on update_time\n    AND update_time >= $2\n  GROUP BY id\n) latest\nINNER JOIN test t USING (id, update_time)",
